cdl:Connector rdfs:comment "A connector belongs to exactly one Function Block. The Connector class is the union of two disjoint subclasses; InputConnector and OutputConnector." .

cdl:Constant rdfs:comment "A constant is a parameter with constant value." .

cdl:Parameter rdfs:comment "A parameter belongs to exactly one Function Block." .

cdl:Datatype rdfs:comment "A datatype description for function block connectors, parameters, and constants." .

cdl:FunctionBlock rdfs:comment "A FunctionBlock is the abstract interface of some algorithm." .

cdl:InputConnector rdfs:comment "An input connector is a type of Connector that is an input to a Function Block." .

cdl:OutputConnector rdfs:comment "An output connector is a type of Connector that is an output from a Function Block." .

