_:node16240 rdfs:comment "If the relation property-identifier is present it is either a decimal number or exactly equal to the ASHRAE 135-2020 Clause 21 identifier text of BACnetPropertyIdentifier. If it is omitted, it defaults to \"present-value\" except for BACnet File objects, where absence of property-identifier refers to the entire content of the file accessed with Stream Access." .

