qudtqk:StoichiometricNumber qudt:latexSymbol "\\(\\nu_B\\)"^^qudt:LatexString .

qudtqk:ElectromagneticPermeability qudt:latexSymbol "\\(\\mu\\)"^^qudt:LatexString .

